  "title": "MNE-somato-data-bids (anonymized)",
  "description": "The MNE-somato-data somatosensory MEG dataset converted to BIDS format using MNE-BIDS. It includes an anonymized MEG recording with an anatomical T1-weighted MRI. Derivatives contain FreeSurfer recon-all reconstructions, scalp and watershed BEM surfaces, and a forward model for source analysis.",
  "methods_description": "Anatomical MRI was processed with FreeSurfer recon-all using default options. Scalp surfaces and BEM models were then generated with MNE make_scalp_surfaces and watershed_bem. A forward solution was computed from the source space, a head-MRI transform, and the BEM solution. The BIDS conversion is reproducible via a Python script in the /code directory.",
